    a. Monitor the entire process from production, inspection, to warehousing, ensuring finished goods are stored and shipped on time;
    b. Rapidly coordinate resources to resolve delivery disruptions caused by capacity shortfalls, quality issues, material shortages, or staffing gaps, and escalate progress promptly.

